            <ArticleTitle>Spotlight article: thrombolysis in unstable angina: randomized double-blind trial of t-PA and placebo. Circulation 1992;85: 150-7. (Freeman MR, Langer A, Wilson RF, Morgan CD, Armstrong PW.).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>502-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is a well-written and executed study that indicates that infusion of t-PA in patients with unstable angina does not decrease in-hospital cardiac events and, in fact, may worsen myocardial perfusion. The small sample size requires further study replication.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
